type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-01-15T14:26:18Z","updated_at":"2017-01-15T14:26:18Z","body":"It looks like now the barycentric z coordinate is never assigned, instead the value passed for it is merely divided by a determinant? (https://github.com/g-truc/glm/blob/master/glm/gtx/intersect.inl#L89)\r\n\r\nAlso, the test case doesn't actually use the z coordinate for the triangle vertices which makes it impossible to catch this \"bug\" (?) with it: https://github.com/g-truc/glm/blob/master/test/gtx/gtx_intersect.cpp#L12\r\n\r\nI guess you can always calculate it from the other two coordinates, in which case a little documentation about that would be very appreciated.\r\n\r\nOr am I missing something?\r\n\r\nKind regards, Jonathan.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/272698410/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Squareys","id":1889284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODkyODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1889284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys","html_url":"https://github.com/Squareys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Squareys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"u