rl":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot","html_url":"https://github.com/nlguillemot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-08-08T14:38:56Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/473578899","html_url":"https://github.com/g-truc/glm/issues/6#issuecomment-473578899","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/6","id":473578899,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ3MzU3ODg5OQ==","user":{"login":"jpanneton","id":15305700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzA1NzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15305700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton","html_url":"https://github.com/jpanneton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-03-16T19:50:45Z","updated_at":"2019-03-16T19:53:51Z","body":"@nlguillemot \r\nNote that when calling glm::intersectRayTriangle(orig, dir, v0, v1, v2, baryPosition),\r\n`intersection = orig + baryPosition.z * dir`\r\nshould in theory be equal to\r\n`intersection = v0 + (baryPosition.x * (v1 - v0) + baryPosition.y * (v2 - v0))`\r\nHowever, in practice, the latter is more accurate than the former.\r\nIn fact, I was playing with a 3D Gaussian function the other day and as we all know, this function usually converge to 0 pretty quickly. So, I tried to draw a contour line around it at mouse position using glm::intersectRayTriangle and it turned out that using the latter allowed me to draw the contour line further and more accurately than the former (using the resulting y-coordinate of the intersection to generate it).\r\n\r\nSo, if floating-point precision is an issue, use the latter.\r\nOtherwise, since it's faster to compute, use the former.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/comments/473578899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jpanneton","id":15305700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzA1NzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15305700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton","html_url":"https://github.com/jpanneton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jpanneton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2208343496,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjIwODM0MzQ5Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/events/2208343496","actor":{"login":"nlguillemot","id":1079061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1079061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot","html_url":"https://github.com/nlguillemot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-03-16T19:50:45Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2208343497,"node_id":"MDE1OlN1YnNjcmliZWRFdmVudDIyMDgzNDM0OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/events/2208343497","actor":{"login":"nlguillemot","id":1079061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1079061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nlguillemot","html_url":"https://github.com/nlguil